  "limits": [
    "The models use bounded atomic transitions and fairness, not implementation refinement or wall-clock proof.",
    "The tests assume healthy storage, a surviving monitor, responsive Docker operations, and cooperative ownership.",
    "The exit-handling acknowledgment is not a successful-stop record or durable publication.",
    "The B37 boundary rejects stop requests explicitly. Its historical surviving-writer result remains unchanged.",
    "Snapshots identify source bytes, not execution coverage for every captured file.",
    "Monitor health, late creation, other launch and crash paths, storage faults, safe reclamation, aggregate deadlines, and reserve bounds remain open.",
    "Hosted checks, enforcement, maintainer review, claim ratification, D2, and acceptance remain pending."
  ]
}
